<Slide notes={`选入实验的时候，系统会把公共作者资源递归复制一份。地图、智能体、技能，内容完整地复制过去，形成这个实验自己的副本。

复制这件事带来一个很实际的后果：从这一步开始，两边各改各的。你在公共地图上调整一个区块，已经建好的实验里的地图副本不会跟着变；反过来也一样。想让两边一致，只能各自改一遍。

还有一点要提醒：两边可以出现完全相同的资源名称。所以只看名字判断不了自己在改哪一份，必须看当前实验名称和范围提示。

编辑之前先确认范围，保存之后再从同一个入口重新打开，核对一遍是不是真的落在想改的那一边。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.2.1　先看清正在编辑哪一份内容</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>选入实验时复制，之后各改各的</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 22 }}>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>选入实验时递归复制完整内容；从这一刻起两边各自独立，公共配置的修改不会自动同步。</Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>

            <Box style={{ width: 380, height: 260, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>基础配置：公共作者资源</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 348, height: 48, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', padding: '0 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#20344B' }}>地图</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 348, height: 48, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', padding: '0 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#20344B' }}>智能体 / 人群</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 348, height: 48, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', padding: '0 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#20344B' }}>技能 / 大脑</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 260, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 236, height: 260, background: '#F7F3E8', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>递归复制</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>选入实验时，复制完整内容；此后各自独立</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 260, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#26816B' }}>›</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 380, height: 260, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>当前实验：实验独立副本</Text>
                <Box style={{ width: 348, height: 48, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', padding: '0 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#20344B' }}>地图副本</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 348, height: 48, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', padding: '0 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#20344B' }}>人物副本</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 348, height: 48, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', padding: '0 14px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#20344B' }}>Skill 副本</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 76, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 20px', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#CB6B28' }} />
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>两边可以出现相同的资源名称</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>进入地图编辑器前，先用实验名称与范围提示确认自己在哪一侧；保存后从同一入口重开核对。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.2 认识界面与作者资源</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>04 / 22</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
